{"4044080": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Workers Comp", "steam_appid": 4044080, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Workers Comp is a Coop Immersive Sim about repairing facilities in the midst of a disaster scenario.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4044080/extras/986ed6545a1ad6009c98ac22aecbafe7.avif?t=1771425969\" width=1560 height=310 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Choose an atmospheric sci-fi environment to explore and save! Will it be a nuclear reactor on the verge of meltdown, a space station running out of oxygen, or an underground mine nearing collapse?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4044080/extras/6abb6b56179c710f4953d4d41abfe34b.poster.avif?t=1771425969\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4044080/extras/6abb6b56179c710f4953d4d41abfe34b.webm?t=1771425969\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4044080/extras/6abb6b56179c710f4953d4d41abfe34b.mp4?t=1771425969\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4044080/extras/8d75abe924541244067a635f16819a20.avif?t=1771425969\" width=1560 height=310 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore the facility to uncover its secrets. Scan your surroundings to find problems and plan out your moves!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4044080/extras/276ac8581502180fe3753b9b55a23eca.poster.avif?t=1771425969\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4044080/extras/276ac8581502180fe3753b9b55a23eca.webm?t=1771425969\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4044080/extras/276ac8581502180fe3753b9b55a23eca.mp4?t=1771425969\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4044080/extras/4d28371dd91de724732b46adbc660437.avif?t=1771425969\" width=1560 height=310 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The facility is full of cracks, broken pipes, and faulty control panels. You'll need to find and repair them all to get things back to working order.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4044080/extras/057af91a00c138420f039461d7aabdf5.poster.avif?t=1771425969\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4044080/extras/057af91a00c138420f039461d7aabdf5.webm?t=1771425969\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4044080/extras/057af91a00c138420f039461d7aabdf5.mp4?t=1771425969\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4044080/extras/8cce8708b32e975a1760c8b56e6b00c1.avif?t=1771425969\" width=1560 height=310 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You can't be in two places at once, but that's what friends are for! Spread out to handle distant tasks faster, and group up to hammer away at big tasks together.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4044080/extras/a7d5114dd4e02ce26e3b84fcba605b02.poster.avif?t=1771425969\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4044080/extras/a7d5114dd4e02ce26e3b84fcba605b02.webm?t=1771425969\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4044080/extras/a7d5114dd4e02ce26e3b84fcba605b02.mp4?t=1771425969\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4044080/extras/4a424adb32d81af58d658509804858c0.avif?t=1771425969\" width=1560 height=310 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Time waits for no man (or robot). Finish your repairs before the facility collapses around you!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4044080/extras/10fb284563294e009516b0c0158d0693.poster.avif?t=1771425969\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4044080/extras/10fb284563294e009516b0c0158d0693.webm?t=1771425969\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4044080/extras/10fb284563294e009516b0c0158d0693.mp4?t=1771425969\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Online and LAN Co-Op for up to 4 Players</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Atmospheric Sci-Fi Levels</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Time-Management Challenges</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Character Customization</p></li></ul>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Workers Comp is a Coop Immersive Sim about repairing facilities in the midst of a disaster scenario.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4044080/extras/986ed6545a1ad6009c98ac22aecbafe7.avif?t=1771425969\" width=1560 height=310 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Choose an atmospheric sci-fi environment to explore and save! Will it be a nuclear reactor on the verge of meltdown, a space station running out of oxygen, or an underground mine nearing collapse?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4044080/extras/6abb6b56179c710f4953d4d41abfe34b.poster.avif?t=1771425969\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4044080/extras/6abb6b56179c710f4953d4d41abfe34b.webm?t=1771425969\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4044080/extras/6abb6b56179c710f4953d4d41abfe34b.mp4?t=1771425969\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4044080/extras/8d75abe924541244067a635f16819a20.avif?t=1771425969\" width=1560 height=310 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore the facility to uncover its secrets. Scan your surroundings to find problems and plan out your moves!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4044080/extras/276ac8581502180fe3753b9b55a23eca.poster.avif?t=1771425969\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4044080/extras/276ac8581502180fe3753b9b55a23eca.webm?t=1771425969\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4044080/extras/276ac8581502180fe3753b9b55a23eca.mp4?t=1771425969\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4044080/extras/4d28371dd91de724732b46adbc660437.avif?t=1771425969\" width=1560 height=310 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The facility is full of cracks, broken pipes, and faulty control panels. You'll need to find and repair them all to get things back to working order.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4044080/extras/057af91a00c138420f039461d7aabdf5.poster.avif?t=1771425969\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4044080/extras/057af91a00c138420f039461d7aabdf5.webm?t=1771425969\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https: